bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1376515-if-archmages-aren-t-a-thing-in-m20-how-do-you-handle-say-porthos?p=1395898#post1395898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> now that I actually read your first post I\u2019m reconsidering my answer. Did they actually say in M20 that Archmages weren\u2019t a thing anymore?</div> </div> </div> </div>No. They're part of the story. More like part of history. They mention the existence of archspheres as kind of part of the setting but their use as optional and discouraged","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-12T06:11:14-07:00","id":1396006,"title":"","content":"Interesting point about Unnamed, he is listed with an Avatar of 10, which I hadn't remembered. Is this the only listing of an Avatar over 5? I thought 5 as the limit was pretty explicit. Or has it just been to long since I've read the older books?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"ra